# Logic Builder App — Quick Guide

Short setup guide. Full product overview lives in [README.md](./README.md).

## Prerequisites

- **Node.js 20+** — [nodejs.org](https://nodejs.org) (LTS)
- **uv** (Python tooling) — [astral.sh/uv](https://github.com/astral-sh/uv)

```bash
